Subject: [PATCH 2401/3799] soh: rename func_809BD6B8 -> EnBigokuta_SetupSpin

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: picks the spin duration from whether the octopus is facing the player and turns AC off
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
index c131a1c84..36204362e 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bigokuta/z_en_bigokuta.c
@@ -380,7 +380,8 @@ void EnBigokuta_SetupDeath(EnBigokuta* this) {
     this->actionFunc = func_809BE26C;
 }
 
-void func_809BD6B8(EnBigokuta* this) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_809BD6B8: picks the spin duration from whether the octopus is facing the player and turns AC off
+void EnBigokuta_SetupSpin(EnBigokuta* this) {
     if (!this->unk_195) {
         if (Rand_ZeroOne() < 0.5f) {
             this->unk_196 = 24;
@@ -611,7 +612,7 @@ void func_809BE058(EnBigokuta* this, PlayState* play) {
         player->actor.world.pos.z -= speedXZ * Math_CosS(this->actor.shape.rot.y);
     }
     if (this->unk_196 == 0) {
-        func_809BD6B8(this);
+        EnBigokuta_SetupSpin(this);  // was func_809BD6B8 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
